{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/133375-new-player-looking-for-a-nwod-tutorial-game","id":133375,"title":"New Player Looking for a nWoD Tutorial Game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-12T01:49:51-07:00","id":133375,"title":"New Player Looking for a nWoD Tutorial Game","content":"I'm new to these forums and I've never played nWoD before. All the things I know of it came from a few days of casual research. From what I've already seen and read, I'm pretty eager to start playing. But since I'm completely new to this, I'll need to create a character and play a tutorial game. So, anyone willing to/planning to run a game like this?<br /> <br /> I may not have really played tabletop RPGs before, but I am very familiar with the concept(older siblings used to play D&amp;D <i>a lot</i>) and I have role-played online in forums and chats over the years. I also happen to be a quick learner, so I should grasp the concept very easily. I do have particular leanings to Hunter: the Vigil, as I love the whole &quot;humans fighting back&quot; vibe, but I'm perfectly willing to try any of the other games.<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance, and I look forward to the shadows.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T04:00:14-07:00","id":133477,"title":"","content":"I could run an introductory game for you if you like, either with pregen characters and something like the <i>Nightmare at Hill Manor</i> premade story, or something off-the-cuff. It would probably just be 1-on-1 unless someone else wants an introductory game. Would you prefer something chat-based with some visual (I'm thinking Roll20) or a pbp here on the forums? I'm thinking pure mortal before tackling Hunter, if that's okay with you. Same sort of theme of mundane fighting back against supernatural, just not picking up the added mechanics of Hunter right away.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">A monster by any other name...</span></i>","edited":{"userid":1204,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1204-bridgewarden","user":"BridgeWarden","date":". 05-12-2014, 07:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1204-bridgewarden","name":"BridgeWarden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1204_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T04:31:54-07:00","id":133489,"title":"","content":"1-on-1 pure mortal with pre-made characters and story? Sure, I can dig that! I've got a roll20 account(Crap Carp), so that'll work out great(never used it before, though).<br /> <br /> However, it's important to note that I live in New Zealand, so I've got a rather unusual timezone(<a href=\"http://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/new-zealand/auckland\" target=\"_blank\">+12 hours UTC/GMT</a>). I'm completely free from Friday to Sunday(my time, which is like Thursday to Saturday for most places). Anytime during those days would be great!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T04:52:34-07:00","id":133497,"title":"","content":"Hmm, that time difference is going to be a little tough. If you're able to stay up later I can try to wake up earlier and that should give us some time for an intro game. You're about 16 hours ahead of me, but we can also just do pbp if our schedules don't line up. I'll message you with a link to the campaign I'm going to set up, along with some character concepts to choose from.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">A monster by any other name...</span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1204-bridgewarden","name":"BridgeWarden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1204_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}